Place Previous Year Question papers here.

Accepted formats:
1. PDF (will be parsed and chunked per question)
2. JSON (structured format — preferred for metadata accuracy)

JSON format example:
[
  {
    "subject": "DBMS",
    "year": 2024,
    "semester": "even",
    "unit": "Unit 3",
    "topic": "Normalization",
    "question": "Explain 3NF with a suitable example.",
    "marks": 5
  }
]

Naming convention: {SUBJECT}_{YEAR}_pyq.pdf or {SUBJECT}_{YEAR}_pyq.json
